<title>UK: GECC sets 150 mln euro five-year bond.</title>
<headline>GECC sets 150 mln euro five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN EURO  COUPON     5.125     MATURITY    10.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.495   PAY DATE    10 JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.87     SPREAD	+3 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
